<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool crop condition ratings.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool crop condition ratings.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday revised its crop condition ratings downward to 55 from 61 the week before.</p>
<p>AWP crop condition index of 100 represents optimal growing conditions while 50 represents average crop output. CROP THIS WEEK LAST YEAR Hard Red Spring Wheat 55 72 CPS Wheat 58 72 Soft White Spring Wheat58 66 Winter Wheat 47 57 Durum Wheat 47 57 Oats 56 77 Barley 58 72 Flax 42 66 Rye 57 64 Canola 50 72 Average Crop Condition:55 73</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Reuters Winnipeg Bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
